# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER commit device dumps or extracted filesystems: they contain LIVE, PLAIN-
# TEXT CREDENTIALS from the unit (admin/config passwords in sys/config/sec.0.cfg,
# NTP keys in ntpkeys.0.cfg, SNMP community strings in snmp.0.cfg) plus logs that
# may contain site/location data. Keep these local to the machine that made them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
dumps/
*.bin

# Third-party datasheets (Triscend/GoAhead) are copyrighted by their owners and
# are not redistributed here; see docs/ notes for where to obtain them.
docs/*.pdf

# Local-only working notes — not for publication
private/

# Python / editor noise
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
